{
  "title": "VPC Peering · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "두 VPC 사이에 사설 IP 연결을 만든다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Peering</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#requester-and-accepter\">Requester and Accepter</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#non-overlapping-cidr\">Non-overlapping CIDR</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#non-transitive-routing\">Non-transitive Routing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#inter-region-peering\">Inter-Region Peering</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#dns-resolution\">DNS Resolution</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#peering-or-transit-gateway\">Peering or Transit Gateway</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>59 / 62</span></div><h1>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Peering</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 6 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Peering은 두 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> 사이에서 Private IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>·IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span>로 통신하도록 연결한다. 같은 계정뿐 아니라 계정 간·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 간에도 지원한다.</p><p>Peering을 승인한 뒤 양쪽 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a>과 보안 정책을 설정해야 실제 통신한다. 연결의 존재와 Route의 존재를 혼동하면 안 된다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Peering의 비전이성\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Peering의 비전이성</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Direct peer</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> A</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a> 겹침 없음</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Peering A–B</strong><small>양쪽 Route·Security 설정</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> B</strong><small>직접 연결 범위</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Transitive requirement</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> A → <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> C</strong><small>B를 통과하려는 요구</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>A–B + B–C</strong><small>Peering만으로 전이 불가</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Direct peer / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a></strong><small>지원 구조로 다시 설계</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Peering은 상대 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>의 인터넷 Gateway를 공통 출구로 공유하는 Transit 연결이 아니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"requester-and-accepter\"><h2>Requester and Accepter<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#requester-and-accepter\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>가 요청하고 상대가 수락해 연결을 활성화한다. 계정 간 연결에서는 소유자와 승인 절차를 확인한다. 연결 상태가 Active여도 Route·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>이 준비되지 않았다면 패킷은 전달되지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"non-overlapping-cidr\"><h2>Non-overlapping CIDR <span class=\"full-name\">(Classless Inter-Domain Routing)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#non-overlapping-cidr\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>서로 겹치는 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>·IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>의 Peering에는 제약이 있다. 연결 전에 주소 계획을 맞추는 것이 중요하다. 주소가 겹치는 서비스를 공유해야 할 때는 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\">PrivateLink</a> 방식 등 다른 모델을 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"non-transitive-routing\"><h2>Non-transitive Routing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#non-transitive-routing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>A-B와 B-C Peering이 있다고 A-C 경로가 생기지 않는다. 필요한 두 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>마다 직접 연결하거나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>를 사용한다. B의 인터넷·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN</a> Gateway를 A가 자동으로 공유하는 연결도 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"inter-region-peering\"><h2>Inter-Region Peering<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#inter-region-peering\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>서로 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>를 연결하며 트래픽은 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Backbone을 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 사이의 거리로 인한 지연과 전송 비용은 남는다. 데이터 복제 기능이 자동으로 생기는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"dns-resolution\"><h2>DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> Resolution<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#dns-resolution\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Peering의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#dns-resolution\">DNS Resolution</a> 옵션과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 설정을 구성하면 상대의 일부 이름을 Private IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>로 해석할 수 있다. 단순 연결 생성만으로 모든 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/#hosted-zones-and-dns-records\">Private Hosted Zone</a>이 공유되는 것은 아니다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 이름의 소유와 Resolver 경로를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"peering-or-transit-gateway\"><h2>Peering or Transit Gateway<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#peering-or-transit-gateway\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>소수 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>의 단순 연결에는 Peering이 적합할 수 있다. 연결 수가 늘면 Full Mesh 관리와 Route 수가 증가하므로 중앙 Transit Hub를 비교한다. 비용, Transit 필요성, 계정 분리를 기준으로 판단한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>세 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>가 서로 모두 통신해야 한다면 세 Peering을 직접 구성하거나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>를 사용한다. 두 Peering만 연결하고 Transit을 기대하면 실패한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>A↔B와 B↔C만으로 A↔C가 연결되지 않는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/peering/what-is-vpc-peering.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vpc/latest/peering/what-is-vpc-peering.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q008/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q008\" data-question=\"Q008\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q008</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q008/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A route table has 10.0.0.0/16 to a peering connection and 10.0.1.0/24 to a local target. Which principle determines the route for 10.0.1.25?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Shortest prefix match</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The route created first</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compare only the last octet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Longest prefix match</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 목적지 전체 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>을 비교해 더 구체적인 일치 경로를 우선한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q019\" data-question=\"Q019\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q019</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q019/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">VPC A is peered with VPC B, and VPC B is peered with VPC C. Can A reach C through B using these peering connections?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q019\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if A&#x27;s security group allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q019\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. VPC peering does not support transitive routing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q019\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if B has a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q019\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, by default</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a>은 비전이적이다. 별도 연결이나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q094\" data-question=\"Q094\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q094</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q094/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">One VPC uses 10.0.0.0/16 and a VPC it must connect to uses 10.0.1.0/24. What prevents VPC peering between them?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The presence of route tables</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The CIDR ranges overlap</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The VPCs are in different AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Each VPC has an ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · 겹치는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a> 연결에 사용할 수 없다. 주소 계획부터 바꿔야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q005\" data-question=\"Q005\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q005</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q005/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company plans to create one subnet in each of two Availability Zones. Which resource contains the network address range for those subnets?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A VPC</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 범위이고 그 안의 각 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>은 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 속한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q006\" data-question=\"Q006\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q006</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q006/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which IP address falls within the 10.0.1.0/24 CIDR block?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q006\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.2.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q006\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.1.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q006\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">10.1.1.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q006\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.0.124</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · /24는 앞 24비트, 곧 이 예시의 10.0.1이 같아야 한다. AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 예약 주소 여부도 별도로 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">이전 용어 <b>VPC Endpoint</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">다음 용어 <b>VPN / Direct Connect</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
